{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_02",
  "title": "叛亂前哨",
  "storyCode": "TW-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "764590a49c7e0b886fd71318e1991437e208e0cb14c9ccd3499e7e29b6d47052",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 2下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——他們是什麼時候潛上來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不清楚，但是“留聲機”沒有啟動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早說過那種實驗性的自律施術單元裝置不可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要那些感染者隊伍裡有其他受過高等教育的萊塔尼亞人，篡奪它們，很簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在說這個也來不及了，感染者居住區到處都有他們的蹤跡，呃，他們在煽動感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沃倫姆德的居民都不會那麼輕易被煽動起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可，可的確有越來越多人開始抗議，他們聚集在一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼訴求？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們要求恢復十二音街道的物資供應......還要求我們撤銷對十二音街道的所有隔離措施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......簡直胡鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，最關鍵的......還是他們要求對火災一事給出正式回應......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們根本不關心火災......看著吧，很快所有人都會忘記這個初衷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦？羅德島的人也已經抵達了，暴露只是時間問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我們都清楚，不然我為什麼要讓塔佳娜去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過在向羅德島攤牌之前，我們得確定他們是一個什麼樣的公司......確定他們是安托那樣的感染者，還是“他們”那樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不確定這麼做對不對......讓她們發現我們在隱瞞難道不會加劇分歧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......隨你怎麼想吧，會翻臉的人總會翻臉的，現在沃倫姆德什麼情況，你我心知肚明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這我清楚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那就別指望當什麼好人了，好人下場都不太好，結果更重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳......那些真正麻煩的傢伙們呢？比如魔族之類的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還沒有和我們正式接觸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一群趁火打劫的劫匪，煽動鎮民，創造空隙，很常見的伎倆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們很謹慎，在試探虛實，如果讓他們確信現在的沃倫姆德沒有憲兵隊駐紮的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡每一個人都做好了戰鬥的準備，我們還有L-44“留聲機”防禦系統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你們畢竟不是真正的憲兵......唉，我只想少出點人命，咳咳——咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請保重身體，沃倫姆德還不能失去你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎，我倒覺得無所謂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有誰能在其實一個憲兵都沒有的情況下，保證沃倫姆德的治安環境不至於崩潰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是倔強的血統作祟罷了，高貴的萊塔尼亞人放不下身段行齷齪之事，只要再推他們一把，這裡就會變成人間地獄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再不想出辦法，我們很快就會玩完的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少在入冬之前，我們得回到正常的航線，而不是繼續停留在這片廢土上，饑荒和暴動會毀了這座城鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許，嗯......你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天已經轉涼了，咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但願沃倫姆德還有其他的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，你們兩個是哪裡來的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們也要幫著這些蠢貨嗎，把我們關在這裡等死！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安分點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才你們在聽誰說話？你們告訴了他什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，怕了嗎？這就對了！你們當然會怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為你們這些吃官飯的那麼無能，沃倫姆德才會淪落到今天的樣子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，不如讓我們親自來掌控一切！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是任何人的錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把責任怪給天災就完事了嗎！？本來就是因為你們的失誤，我們才沒來得及跑掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你這是無理取鬧，感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去過其他城市嗎？你見過其他感染者生活的處境嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是我也能看出沃倫姆德的窘境，其他人和感染者過著一樣的日子，這不正是需要攜手並進的緊要關頭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？你又是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島幹員，感染者醫生，我們會幫助感染者們渡過難關，前提是，不要惹是生非。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你好，可以的話，請放棄抵抗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁！還不是在仗勢欺人，要不是我打不過你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攜手並進，幫助？說得好聽，是誰先開始反目成仇的，你問問那個女人吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喂，你，你也是感染者吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有著九條尾巴的沃爾珀可不常見，你遲早也會淪落到我這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有的事......大家都對我很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算不是在現在，就算不是在這裡，也遲早會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果安托醫生還在的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！你幹什麼，鬆手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐，冷靜一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才說，你剛才說安托醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她現在在哪兒？她怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼她在哪兒，那場火災奪走了一切！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大裂谷出現之後他們就開始排擠我們，他們在恐懼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些逃難來的感染者也被他們聚集在一起！為什麼，為了控制住我們，為了讓他們虛偽的人道精神滿足，他們把我們豢養了起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒有......塞弗林長官從來沒有這種想法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，隨你的便吧，如果只是這樣......只是這樣我們也滿足了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少有安托醫生，至少我們還能有同伴，就算你們放棄了這條街道，我們也有地方可住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——他們——他們害死了安托醫生，害死了我們的同伴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因為那場大火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你、你要怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安托應該從那場火災裡活下來了才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我懂了，是這樣，他們也騙了你們。對，他們騙了所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那才不是什麼事故，那是縱火，是謀殺！是這些平時道貌岸然的傢伙們露出真面目的證據！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要你情緒化的宣洩——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿，你知道嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——火災發生的那一天，根本沒有一個人從那個帳篷裡逃出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在你知道，你該站在哪邊了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！你就不知道下手輕點——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......冷靜點，你被捕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你根本不是憲兵！你們都不是！這裡根本沒有法律！這裡只有移民者留下的殘羹剩飯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林長官會決定你的下場的，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你們不敢殺我，殺了我就等於和這裡所有的感染者居民決裂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就等著你們把我流放到荒原上，這樣我就能正式加入那些——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你還有你的同夥，你們都認定是我們主導了這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明我們都是這裡的居民，明明我們都是沃倫姆德的一份子，明明那麼多年來都能相安無事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你們寧可信任那些徘徊在荒野裡的可疑感染者，也不願意信任我們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有哪裡做得不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因為你不是冬靈的一份子，你也不是感染者，你安然無恙，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別忘了感染者是什麼，也別忘了礦石病是什麼，現在我比你更清楚，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "民兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到了！塔佳娜在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "民兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有羅德島的二位，你們沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我們沒事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請把他們帶走，麻煩各位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叛亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，又要去見塞弗林......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "民兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會確保他們不再犯事的，可塔佳娜小姐，羅德島的二位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會負責的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "民兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——好的，那我們就先走一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，可以給我一個解釋嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我會告訴二位全部的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我不知道塞弗林長官和代表們是怎麼想的，但我覺得......亞葉小姐，鈴蘭小姐，你們應該得知真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何況你們剛剛幫了我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多說無用，我只想知道......她還活著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不確定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不確定！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亞葉姐姐，別這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔佳娜小姐......為什麼要說謊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們自己都還沒有做好準備接受這一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請理解，我們並不知道羅德島是個什麼樣的公司，我們應該先取得信任——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可就算我們冷血，我們無情，我們會讓沃倫姆德雪上加霜——這也不是你欺瞞我同伴下場的藉口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，我很抱歉，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們並不打算一直瞞著你們......！我們、我們也有在努力調查那些可疑的感染者份子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，我明白的，這都是為了自保而已，這不是藉口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說得沒錯，這只是藉口而已。但也......無可厚非。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只想......我只想知道真相。羅德島不會拋下你們，拋下因感染者問題深陷困境的一座城鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則安托會不高興的，她一不高興就要哭，我不喜歡她哭的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在還不算太遲，對你我來說都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫助感染者，解決感染者問題，這就是我們羅德島幹員的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔佳娜小姐，如果我們互相信任，可以做到更多的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在天災發生前，長官曾經問過安托醫生，要不要跟著難民們一起離開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時安托醫生說的也是——“羅德島不會拋下你們的。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
